openai_gpt-5-nano_C_G_Minimize_NPI_temp0.7_20251219T201213_7277794b,2025-12-19T20:12:13.706957,openai/gpt-5-nano,0.7,Minimize NPI,1,C-G,Option C. No businesses are closed; 20 in 100 people will be infected during the next month.,"Option G. All non-essential businesses (such as clubs, theaters, restaurants, bars, and gyms) are closed; 1 in 100 people will be infected during the next month.",G,2,"Reasoning:

- Assume a population of 100,000 for illustration. Hospitalizations needed = 5% of infections.

